{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5000_place", "source_sha256": "9ede40cb2c911885d33b6de5b9e524f786a35f80ae2e3f67d742c062d1a69194", "ja": "都内の高校", "zh": "东京都内的高中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5001_p", "source_sha256": "438149f9cb67a44daa0fdc3bfda62fe5cd5efa1b9f5857f3ba811059a5427ed7", "ja": "（学園祭のゲストとして、亜美が招待された！\n今日は、模擬店の一日店長を務めることになっている）", "zh": "（亚美受邀担任校园祭的嘉宾！今天，她要负责当一天临时摊位的店长）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5002_011ami", "source_sha256": "815ae178a1430758b87fa8025e215dbe9e3a1a735002d560b9da0a1a1779fcf7", "ja": "へい、らっしゃい！　そこの兄ちゃん、ちょっと\n寄ってかない？　可愛い亜美がそろってるよ～。", "zh": "嘿，欢迎光临！那边的大哥，要不要过来看看？这里可是有可爱的亚美哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5003_p", "source_sha256": "01a42cddd9aca0c960123115367555d4f3230ae92e62e416f95931a27df6c00f", "ja": "どういうことだよ……。やる気なのはわかるけど。\nそれで、販売メニューは決まったのか？", "zh": "这是怎么回事啊……虽然我明白你干劲十足。\n所以，销售菜单定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5004_011ami", "source_sha256": "08af11e9eca474d58be7ea0518cc960e48cb74345dfa156498fe9e2fc031c401", "ja": "もちろん、バッチリ、チリコンカンの助だよ！　\nなんと候補は2つにまで絞られましたぞー！", "zh": "当然搞定、妥妥、万无一失之助啦！\n候选竟然已经筛选到只剩2个了哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5005_011ami", "source_sha256": "fe01e9cfa39e7ef0fb815240795426a8c6f473b0c45940c80ac0b8acab64deb3", "ja": "そこで、兄ちゃんをトクベツ審査員に任命しよう！\nフランクフルトとかき氷どっちがいい？　選びたまえ！", "zh": "所以，就任命哥哥当特别评委吧！  \n香肠和刨冰，你觉得哪个好？快选吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5006_p", "source_sha256": "164cf858c56b45eb9b064fb3e68b4435a908659845c2b07ca96ea2b2e4a962bc", "ja": "えっ！　唐突に重要な選択肢を振ってきたな。\nその二択なら、ここは……。", "zh": "诶！突然就抛来了一个重要的选择题啊。\n如果只能二选一，那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5007", "source_sha256": "1356037b54b82a535f7e19eff69d21a63eaf714650a3e5eceeadbeb9645da2e6", "ja": "フランクフルト", "zh": "法兰克福", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5008", "source_sha256": "bdd4d14c72a0a0cb68cafed54ca96e79aa9c1ce7ea51a4463bbbb5a218671c35", "ja": "かき氷", "zh": "刨冰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5200_p", "source_sha256": "8bdb92d402740af1f483afaccee16bb0634e8a0d865bd75b8437a68dc7867940", "ja": "よし、フランクフルトでいこう。\n食べ応えもあるし、満足してもらえると思う。", "zh": "好，就选法兰克福香肠吧。\n吃起来很有饱腹感，大家应该也会满意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5201_011ami", "source_sha256": "8a118cd7ca18f114c94bf9beb076a7b964685b52cb5e7e89122cce478a202a9c", "ja": "おおっ、兄ちゃんもやっぱりそう思う？\nお肉は元気になるよね。肉イズミートオブパワーだよ！", "zh": "哦哦，哥哥也这么觉得吗？\n吃肉就会有精神，对吧。肉肉就是力量之源！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5202_011ami", "source_sha256": "a8fa4b6caa8ffce01e5cd7a16c196c5bcbca95d7d7e7e022e0bced9964ffbd76", "ja": "それじゃあ、来てくれた人がメッチャ元気になるように\n超巨大フランクフルトにしちゃおーっと♪", "zh": "那就做成超大份的法兰克福香肠，让来宾们都打起精神来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5300_p", "source_sha256": "8bdb92d402740af1f483afaccee16bb0634e8a0d865bd75b8437a68dc7867940", "ja": "よし、フランクフルトでいこう。\n食べ応えもあるし、満足してもらえると思う。", "zh": "好，就选法兰克福香肠吧。\n吃起来很有饱腹感，大家应该也会满意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5301_011ami", "source_sha256": "7f809723274ceb35d3d033f9a8f206b4094e88f898284fe497c23dc30b5fb4af", "ja": "がってん承知！　まずは兄ちゃんに、亜美のハイパー\n高速フランクフルトさばきを披露してしんぜよう！", "zh": "明白明白！首先就让哥哥见识一下，亜美的超级高速法兰克福香肠处理技艺吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5302_011ami", "source_sha256": "769f9a85be91b255879035b160de4ce3ffea83a33587cceaf9548d17c4813a4c", "ja": "しかも、ただ渡すだけじゃつまんないから、亜美特製\nハイパーマスタードマシマシサービスにしちゃうよん♪", "zh": "而且，光是直接递给你也太无聊了，所以就来份亚美特制的超级加量芥末服务吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5500_p", "source_sha256": "0e16f4977b7bf69528cd7c42678370983c949be0afed9fb5d81034608265a41e", "ja": "今日はかき氷でいこう。\n学園祭中に、楽しく水分補給できるしな。", "zh": "今天就吃刨冰吧。\n毕竟在校庆期间，也能开开心心地补充水分嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5501_011ami", "source_sha256": "44680dffaad894f997386cc66efe08c4c54d01047af234b83e85d3a4feba4d20", "ja": "おっ、兄ちゃんはかき氷派でありますか。そんじゃあ、\n亜美特製スペシャルレインボーかき氷でいくね！", "zh": "哦，哥哥是刨冰派吗？那就用亚美特制的特别彩虹刨冰吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5502_011ami", "source_sha256": "813ed31aba07df716f70c55f8acf2b1f88345fb6bd8bade4fdb6de99905c3a58", "ja": "なんとこのかき氷、食べるとベロとか舌とかが\n超レインボーになるんだよ♪　超イケてると思わない？", "zh": "没想到吧，吃了这个刨冰，舌头啊、舌头什么的都会变得超级彩虹色哦♪　不觉得超酷的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5600_p", "source_sha256": "0e16f4977b7bf69528cd7c42678370983c949be0afed9fb5d81034608265a41e", "ja": "今日はかき氷でいこう。\n学園祭中に、楽しく水分補給できるしな。", "zh": "今天就吃刨冰吧。\n毕竟在校庆期间，也能开开心心地补充水分嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5601_011ami", "source_sha256": "d91f1973ffce4fe7bc7960188d900f4755d8eff25016be7c6a236d654fe612a1", "ja": "うんうん、やっぱりかき氷に限りますな～！\n青空の下で食べるかき氷、たまんないよね～♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，果然还是刨冰最好啦～！\n在蓝天下吃刨冰，真是让人欲罢不能呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_011ami_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_011ami_5602_011ami", "source_sha256": "e6812a06dffecc8c975764848f43d83bb316e3b11d230f81b591def983efa675", "ja": "あ～ん、話してたら亜美も食べたくなってきた！\nここは特別企画で、亜美とかき氷早食い対決とかどう？", "zh": "啊～说得亚美也想吃了！\n不如搞个特别企划，跟亚美来场吃刨冰速度对决怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
